    {
      "uid": "zhcn:911f5846a77279d76415dc11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吹起了风、下起了雨，最后变成暴风雨──\n少女和动物们互相帮助、跨越困难，\n少女演奏歌曲；动物们跟着哼唱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de166707e58561f5f343a8f691570957f2814ae7f41e326e9bfd7b36243763ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
