    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8836f7421382db9d9a0f70c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到也文摄辉就会联想到风，\n像这样提起雨倒是很难得。\n于是我抬头看──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e68dd1268eb7b18dc36a808fd837186b3d0f9793fdf06113d8691774628dcb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078705.json",
