      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圆滚滚唱着好风般的歌曲。\n胖嘟嘟跳着煽风般的舞步。\n是的，我觉得非常可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01aefab20e1011b5d6c85a0048b29b6635e6f67881cc6d9615b1c4205ff6285b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
