    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3b59806edf6d00f7a8289a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我喜欢喔。\n滴滴答答，沙沙沙。\n仿佛自己就快融化在雨声里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c84d4b8e5ecc2853f4df24678759625ad1c0b036de0f6f47a7aab7cd087140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078705.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d56a5a1816eee50368e189",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她惬意地站在雨中，\n就像淋湿是再自然不过的事情般，\n那模样让我无法出声阻止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd5ff692c41edf842f8c2bbd358aaa95900159c3687582801a74678fa92c505d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078705.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839a7096c86459e19318a065",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "找个地方躲雨吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f60837253113c3353ab0db4c58a1ee31589454ec8878835a4b2d9785d18873",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
