      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……下雨了。虽然现在还只是毛毛细语，\n但晚点应该就会下得很大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7b3fb45bb3dc7b1d854d3499e776b9eb4a943c14a76d69825df23c0579c248",
